---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<figure class="chat">
  <div class="chat__window">
    <div class="chat__head">
      <span class="chat__avatar"><Icon name="roof" size={22} strokeWidth={2.2} /></span>
      <span class="chat__who">
        <strong>Impercastro</strong>
        <span>Atendimento pelo WhatsApp</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <ol class="chat__body" role="list">
      <li class="msg msg--client msg--photo" style="--i: 0">
        <span class="msg__photo" role="img" aria-label="Foto de exemplo: teto de laje com mancha de umidade"></span>
        <span class="msg__text">Tá infiltrando aqui na laje. O que eu uso?</span>
      </li>
      <li class="msg msg--store" style="--i: 1">Recebemos a foto! Qual o tamanho aproximado da área?</li>
      <li class="msg msg--client" style="--i: 2">Uns 30 m².</li>
      <li class="msg msg--store" style="--i: 3">
        Já te passo o produto e a quantidade. Fica separado pra você retirar aqui na loja.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Exemplo ilustrativo de atendimento</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .chat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .chat__window {
    background: var(--ink-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    border-radius: 22px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .chat__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.08);
  }

  .chat__avatar {
    flex: none;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--ink);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .chat__who {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .chat__who span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-soft-dark);
  }

  .chat__body {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .msg {
    max-width: 84%;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .msg--client {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: var(--ink-3);
    border-radius: 16px 16px 4px 16px;
  }

  .msg--store {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 4px;
  }

  .msg--photo {
    max-width: 80%;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 6px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .msg__photo {
    display: block;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 38% at 58% 46%, #6b6352 0%, #8a8270 45%, rgba(138, 130, 112, 0) 75%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 22% 18% at 40% 62%, #756c5a 0%, rgba(117, 108, 90, 0) 70%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #b9b3a6, #a39c8e);
  }

  .msg__text {
    padding: 2px 8px 6px;
  }

  figcaption {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #8c8577;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  /* Mensagens entram em sequência, uma única vez */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .msg {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: msg-in 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) forwards;
      animation-delay: calc(0.35s + var(--i) * 0.55s);
    }
  }

  @keyframes msg-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .chat__head {
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .chat__body {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .msg__photo {
      height: 120px;
    }
  }
</style>
